---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Editorial Standards & Affiliate Disclosure | Price Drop Radar">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6">
      <span>FTC & Amazon Associates Compliance</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
      Editorial Standards & FTC Disclosure
    </h1>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 p-5 rounded-xl text-xs text-amber-900 leading-relaxed my-6 font-medium">
      <strong>Important Disclosure:</strong> Price Drop Radar is a free consumer resource. To sustain our automated tracking infrastructure, we participate in affiliate programs, primarily the Amazon Associates Program. When you click on product links on this site and make a purchase, we may receive a commission from Amazon at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>.
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">1. Editorial Independence</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      We do not accept paid placements, sponsored reviews, or merchant compensation to artificially boost deal rankings. A product appears on Price Drop Radar solely because its price has dropped to a verified 90-day historic benchmark.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. Pricing Accuracy & 24-Hour Cache Policy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Amazon prices and product availability fluctuate dynamically. While our automated pipeline checks and refreshes product data continuously, prices on Amazon.com at the moment of purchase will supersede any price displayed on this website. All deal prices displayed include a real-time verification timestamp.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">3. Amazon Associates Statement</h2>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
      <em>"Price Drop Radar is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com."</em>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-500">
      Last Updated: August 2026 • Maloney Marketing Compliance Office
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
